    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Fruitio world! Relax in this atmospheric physics based puzzle game. <br />\r\nMatch fruit bubbles drop down in pairs. Matching fruit will merge together and form a bigger fruit bubble. Fully grown fruit bubbles will pop!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWatch out for Special bubbles:<br />\r\n- Spikey: Pops any bubble it touches<br />\r\n- Blocker: blocks others from merging<br />\r\n- Shrinker: Shrinks grown fruit bubble<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBubble drop speed will increase until it reaches a maximum. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLast as long as you can to get a global high score! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Fruitio world! Relax in this atmospheric physics based puzzle game. <br />\r\nMatch fruit bubbles drop down in pairs. Matching fruit will merge together and form a bigger fruit bubble. Fully grown fruit bubbles will pop!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWatch out for Special bubbles:<br />\r\n- Spikey: Pops any bubble it touches<br />\r\n- Blocker: blocks others from merging<br />\r\n- Shrinker: Shrinks grown fruit bubble<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBubble drop speed will increase until it reaches a maximum. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLast as long as you can to get a global high score! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck!",
